<title>USA: Dinan group cuts Spreckels stake.</title>
<headline>Dinan group cuts Spreckels stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group including Dinan Management L.L.C., a New York-based investment firm, said Tuesday it reduced its stake in Spreckels Industries Inc to the equivalent of 299,200 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it sold a net of 198,600 shares of Spreckles between July 22 and August 28 at prices ranging from $18.10 to $23.62 a share.</p>
<p>The group said its stake includes warrants to buy 240,000 common shares.</p>
</text>
